# MakeFlyEasy stock Believer flight-control parameters (Believer_V4.6.3.param, "MFE-2026-1-30",
# copy in sim/params/reference/), loaded AFTER believer.parm or believer_5kg.parm.
# Taken: controller gains, limits, airspeeds, TECS speed weight, loop rate, radii.
# Changed: AIRSPEED_CRUISE 1900 -> 19 (the file kept the old TRIM_ARSPD_CM value in cm/s; the
#   parameter is m/s since 4.6). 19 also lowers our cruise from 20, as asked.
#   AIRSPEED_MIN 12 -> 14 (2026-11-24; 13.5 asked, but the parameter is an integer): MFE's 12 is only ~1.03x the 5.0 kg model's stall
#   (11.6 m/s) and ~1.07x the 5.9 kg model's (11.2 m/s); 14 gives 1.21x / 1.25x.
# Left out: SERVO1-6_FUNCTION (V-tail 79/80, second aileron and motor; SITL's plane takes separate
#   elevator/rudder channels), FLTMODE*, BATT_CAPACITY 22000 (our packs are 20/25 Ah), AHRS/EK3 and
#   ARMING (same as ours). MIXING_GAIN 1 is kept for the record but drives no servo here: the AVL
#   *_mfe models carry it as 25 deg of ruddervator per axis instead of 12.5.
# MFE's AIRSPEED_MIN 12 suits its 4.2 kg recommended takeoff weight, not our 5.0 / 5.9 kg.

RLL_RATE_D       0
RLL_RATE_FF      0.5706093
RLL_RATE_FLTD    12
RLL_RATE_FLTE    0
RLL_RATE_FLTT    3
RLL_RATE_I       0.02416181
RLL_RATE_IMAX    0.6666667
RLL_RATE_P       0.1162964
RLL_RATE_SMAX    150
RLL2SRV_RMAX     75
RLL2SRV_TCONST   0.45
PTCH_RATE_D      0
PTCH_RATE_FF     0.5171807
PTCH_RATE_FLTD   12
PTCH_RATE_FLTE   0
PTCH_RATE_FLTT   3
PTCH_RATE_I      0.05415507
PTCH_RATE_IMAX   0.6666667
PTCH_RATE_P      0.1083102
PTCH_RATE_SMAX   150
PTCH2SRV_RLL     1.05
PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN 75
PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP 75
PTCH2SRV_TCONST  0.45
YAW_RATE_ENABLE  0
YAW2SRV_DAMP     0.13
YAW2SRV_IMAX     2000
YAW2SRV_INT      0.085
YAW2SRV_RLL      1.2
YAW2SRV_SLIP     0

PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG 15
PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG -25
ROLL_LIMIT_DEG   30
RTL_ALTITUDE     -1
AIRSPEED_MAX     25
AIRSPEED_MIN     14
# AIRSPEED_STALL 12 (2026-11-25, user): the 5.0 kg model stalls at 11.6 m/s; used by stall prevention in banks and as the TECS floor on landing final
AIRSPEED_STALL   12
AIRSPEED_CRUISE  19
WP_LOITER_RAD    120
WP_RADIUS        120
RTL_RADIUS       150
SCHED_LOOP_RATE  100
MIXING_GAIN      1
TECS_SPDWEIGHT   0.8
